"Contribution" shall mean any work of authorship, including original version
of Work and any modifications or additions to Work or Derivative Works
thereof, intentionally submitted to Licensor for inclusion in Work by
copyright owner or by individual or Legal Entity authorized to submit on
behalf of copyright owner. For purposes of this definition, "submitted"
